<chapter xml:id="ch-algebra-expressions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Algebraic Expressions</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Algebra begins with the idea that we can use letters to represent unknown or varying quantities.
      This chapter covers evaluating, simplifying, expanding, and factorising algebraic expressions.
    </p>
  </introduction>

